  "description": "Ad conversions for ITBees FAS applications: a paid purchase is reported to the ad platforms (Meta Conversions API, Google Ads Data Manager API) together with its origin. Platform credentials are kept in the host database and edited in the admin panel (fas-admin view \"Reklamy\"); deliveries are retried and kept as history. The host supplies only the source of paid purchases (IAdConversionSource) and the customer data (IAdConversionCustomerProvider).",
